          "html": "76 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Constitution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Constitution</a> highly recommended, Nomad uses an attack that deals exactly 7,500 damage. If you have 71 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Constitution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Constitution</a>, the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Font_of_Life\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Font of Life</a> relic power can be harnessed to boost the max <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Life_points\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">life points</a> by 500.",
          "text": "76 Constitution highly recommended, Nomad uses an attack that deals exactly 7,500 damage. If you have 71 Constitution, the Font of Life relic power can be harnessed to boost the max life points by 500.",
