    {
      "id": "nomad",
      "title": "Nomad",
      "anchor": "Nomad",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "nomad:cftdy5",
          "html": "Make any necessary preparations to fight Nomad. You can teleport out, and bank to prepare for the fight.",
          "text": "Make any necessary preparations to fight Nomad. You can teleport out, and bank to prepare for the fight.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "nomad:1rw4rnz",
          "html": "To return to the area, teleport to Edgeville, enter into the Soul Wars portal, and investigate the tent again.",
          "text": "To return to the area, teleport to Edgeville, enter into the Soul Wars portal, and investigate the tent again.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "nomad:fz4fnw",
          "html": "Enter the arcane doorway at the northern wall then the arcane doorway on the inner southern wall.",
          "text": "Enter the arcane doorway at the northern wall then the arcane doorway on the inner southern wall.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Yes."
                },
                {
                  "key": "~",
                  "text": "[Any option]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "nomad:nc4m3m",
          "html": "Kill Nomad. (Deathtouched darts work)",
          "text": "Kill Nomad. (Deathtouched darts work)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "nomad:ki9uhn",
          "html": "Strategies can be found <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nomad/Strategies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. Recommended if you haven&#39;t fought him before.",
          "text": "Strategies can be found here. Recommended if you haven't fought him before.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:1czwaan",
              "html": "If you are a high combat level (130+) and have tier 80 gear or higher, you will likely kill him easily without worrying about his final stun ability. Bring high-healing food like shark or sea turtle and just keep attacking him and healing while standing directly beside him.",
              "text": "If you are a high combat level (130+) and have tier 80 gear or higher, you will likely kill him easily without worrying about his final stun ability. Bring high-healing food like shark or sea turtle and just keep attacking him and healing while standing directly beside him.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:x46gax",
              "html": "In short; bombs laid on the floor deal 4,000 damage when stepped on.",
              "text": "In short; bombs laid on the floor deal 4,000 damage when stepped on.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:x46gax:6to40n",
                  "html": "Avoid them by walking DIRECTLY south, he does not place one there.",
                  "text": "Avoid them by walking DIRECTLY south, he does not place one there.",
                  "dialogue": [],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:1uh1lrs",
              "html": "&quot;You cannot hide from my wrath&quot; deals 7,500 damage. Either eat above that or hide behind a pillar.",
              "text": "\"You cannot hide from my wrath\" deals 7,500 damage. Either eat above that or hide behind a pillar.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:1g58ryx",
              "html": "If he summons clones, the real one attacks you last, otherwise kill them all.",
              "text": "If he summons clones, the real one attacks you last, otherwise kill them all.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:1g58ryx:1cd62w5",
                  "html": "An alternative is hide from them, after about 90 seconds the three fake ones will despawn. Make sure to re-attack him quickly after this so he does not reset, he does not use &quot;Face me!&quot; while clones are present.",
                  "text": "An alternative is hide from them, after about 90 seconds the three fake ones will despawn. Make sure to re-attack him quickly after this so he does not reset, he does not use \"Face me!\" while clones are present.",
                  "dialogue": [],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:ja621c",
              "html": "&quot;Face me!&quot; if he doesn&#39;t hit you in time, he restores his life points and teleports you. For example, if you were hiding behind a pillar.",
              "text": "\"Face me!\" if he doesn't hit you in time, he restores his life points and teleports you. For example, if you were hiding behind a pillar.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:b32up2",
              "html": "Towards the end of the fight he teleports you to the centre and stuns you. The next attack deals all your maximum life points, minus 1. So eat to full.",
              "text": "Towards the end of the fight he teleports you to the centre and stuns you. The next attack deals all your maximum life points, minus 1. So eat to full.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:b32up2:1edh5tf",
                  "html": "If you bring a shield, swap to it and use resonance. This blocks the attack 100% but does not heal you.",
                  "text": "If you bring a shield, swap to it and use resonance. This blocks the attack 100% but does not heal you.",
                  "dialogue": [],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "nomad:ki9uhn:n2grzh",
              "html": "&quot;This. Ends. Now&quot; starts attacking you rapidly. It&#39;s important to finish him off at this point and not hide, otherwise he will restore his life points and you&#39;ll have to restart the fight.",
              "text": "\"This. Ends. Now\" starts attacking you rapidly. It's important to finish him off at this point and not hide, otherwise he will restore his life points and you'll have to restart the fight.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
